/godot/issues/comments/5681129775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5681129775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5681129775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUp8pLw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T13:38:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T13:38:35Z","body":"Since #118002, the editor warns about incorrect usage\n\n<img width=\"1202\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4712a625-2495-420b-806a-ff08a4242c2f\" />\n\n`set_split_offset()` needs to get properly exposed to resolve this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681129775/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681207212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5681207212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5681207212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUqBXrA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T13:43:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T13:43:44Z","body":"How should we proceed/classify this? The behavior is a breaking change but it has a warning, should we add a note in the upgrading guide perhaps? Or should we consider this a release blocker still?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681207212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681804212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5681804212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5681804212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUqlztA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:19:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:19:49Z","body":"> The behavior is a breaking change but it has a warning, should we add a note in the upgrading guide perhaps? \n\nIt should definitely be in migration guide, if it isn't already. #113228 was a serious compat break, I still keep finding broken code in my project :/ (in my case it's from Line2D) Luckily the warning makes it manageable.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681804212/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681809808","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5681809808","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5681809808,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUqmJkA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:20:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:20:04Z","body":"> `set_split_offset()` needs to get properly exposed to resolve this issue.\n\nThat's not the issue as I understand it. You can set this perfectly fine, the methods are exposed. The fact is just that GDScript won't store back shared types and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113228 fixed the check for deciding whether packed arrays are a shared type.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681809808/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681894925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5681894925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5681894925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUqrWDQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:24:31Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:24:31Z","body":"Yeah but all (most?) other classes that have packed array properties expose some methods for setting single element. The current `set_split_offset()` takes single argument, so you can set only the first split value.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681894925/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681979793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5681979793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5681979793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUqwhkQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:29:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:29:01Z","body":"It is not listed in the migration guide indeed","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5681979793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5682099600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5682099600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5682099600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUq31kA","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:35:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:35:40Z","body":"When I was updating the SplitContainer API for multiple children, I thought that `split_offsets[0] = 0` was valid, so I didn't expose a dedicated way to set a single property. It is useful to be able to set a single property at a time, so we can undeprecate `set/get_split_offset` and add a optional param to it for the index. (and add new methods to back the deprecated `split_offset`).\nBut I agree that is a separate issue, this is more about broken compat.\n\nIt looks like it is mentioned in the migration guide here https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.7.html#gdscript though it could be more clear.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5682099600/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5682203895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5682203895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5682203895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUq-M9w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-15T14:40:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:40:59Z","body":"Then I'll downgrade this to a clearer description for the migration, we might want to generally update the note in the docs to be more explicit about the changes from this RP, i.e. \"Note: The returned array is copied and any changes to it will not update the original property value. See `PackedInt32Array` for more details.\", to be explicit about subscript similar to the warning","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5682203895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5682261458","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120406#issuecomment-5682261458","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120406","id":5682261458,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUrBt0g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users